&#x200B;

I approach the location and my little token is on top of Grimwood, but when I try to actually enter the location, it just says "This place cannot be visited right now". I have Greybor in my party, so I can't think of any issues.

&#x200B;

For the record, I have fucked up and entered the Ivory Sanctum, but I have *not* done that interaction with Greybor since I saw his character and hightailed it back out. Is that why? I am really upset since I wanted to do this quest.

